param([Parameter(Mandatory=$true)][ValidateSet('direct','group')][string]$TargetKind,[Parameter(Mandatory=$true)][string]$TargetId,[string]$Profile='video-factory',[string]$DeliveryDir='.\tests\fixtures\feishu_delivery',[switch]$Apply)
$ErrorActionPreference='Stop';if(-not(Get-Command lark-cli -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)){throw 'lark-cli not installed.'};$Root=Split-Path -Parent $PSScriptRoot;$Resolved=Resolve-Path (Join-Path $Root $DeliveryDir);Push-Location $Resolved
try{$target=@();if($TargetKind -eq 'direct'){if($TargetId -notmatch '^ou_'){throw 'Direct target must begin ou_.'};$target=@('--user-id',$TargetId)}else{if($TargetId -notmatch '^oc_'){throw 'Group target must begin oc_.'};$target=@('--chat-id',$TargetId)};$profileArgs=@('--profile',$Profile);$key='video-factory-smoke-'+(Get-Date -Format 'yyyyMMddHHmm')
$args=@('im','+messages-send','--as','bot')+$profileArgs+$target+@('--markdown',"## OpenClaw VideoFactory`n`nFeishu CLI smoke test.",'--idempotency-key',($key+'-message'));if(-not $Apply){$args+='--dry-run'};& lark-cli @args;if($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0){throw 'Message test failed.'}
if(Test-Path '.\cover.png'){$a=@('im','+messages-send','--as','bot')+$profileArgs+$target+@('--image','.\cover.png','--idempotency-key',($key+'-cover'));if(-not $Apply){$a+='--dry-run'};& lark-cli @a;if($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0){throw 'Image test failed.'}}
if(Test-Path '.\sample-report.json'){$a=@('im','+messages-send','--as','bot')+$profileArgs+$target+@('--file','.\sample-report.json','--idempotency-key',($key+'-report'));if(-not $Apply){$a+='--dry-run'};& lark-cli @a;if($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0){throw 'File test failed.'}}
if((Test-Path '.\sample.mp4') -and (Test-Path '.\cover.png')){$a=@('im','+messages-send','--as','bot')+$profileArgs+$target+@('--video','.\sample.mp4','--video-cover','.\cover.png','--idempotency-key',($key+'-video'));if(-not $Apply){$a+='--dry-run'};& lark-cli @a;if($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0){throw 'Video test failed.'}}}finally{Pop-Location};if(-not $Apply){Write-Host 'Dry run complete; confirm target then rerun with -Apply.'}
